<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$12 bln in NCDs on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$12 bln in NCDs on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Tuesday it would issue T$12 billion in 41-day negotiable certificates of deposits later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 3.00 p.m. (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
